## 📢 Alert Format
Every violation alert sent to staff looks like this:
```
[AntiCheat] PlayerName failed KillAura x4 | cps=14 max=12
```
- `[AntiCheat]` — dark red, bold
- Player name — yellow
- Check name — red
- Violation level — gold, bold
- Info — gray

