## 📁 Config Overview (`config.yml`)

```yaml
discord-webhook: ""          # Paste your Discord webhook URL here

checks:
  speed:
    enabled: true
    violation-threshold: 5   # Flags before punishment triggers
    punishment: TEMP_BAN      # KICK, TEMP_BAN, or PERM_BAN
    ban-duration: 60          # Minutes (only used for TEMP_BAN)
    max-speed: 0.35

  killaura:
    enabled: true
    violation-threshold: 4
    punishment: TEMP_BAN
    ban-duration: 1440        # 24 hours
    max-hits-per-second: 12
    max-reach: 3.2
  # ... (one section per check)

logging:
  enabled: true
  log-format: "[{timestamp}] {player} ({uuid}) failed {check} - {info}"
```

All settings can also be changed **in-game** via `/nac` without editing files.

